<text x="88.9" y="248.92" size="1.778" layer="97">50 Ohm Impedence required.  There are isolation
circuits (cap and inductor) used for dual antennas.
Since this is single antenna, the isolation circuit is not
used.  Perhaps this is an error on our part, but the 2G
design with single antenna does not have LC circuit.</text>
